1
00:00:00,799 --> 00:00:03,759
- l wouldn't mind a glass.
- l wasn't talking to you.

2
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:09,186
(Raj:)Bring him to his bony knees.

3
00:00:12,102 --> 00:00:13,312
(Howard:)Sheldon, come on back.

4
00:00:13,478 --> 00:00:15,478
Yes, yes!

5
00:00:19,984 --> 00:00:21,064
(Sheldon:)What did you decide?

6
00:00:22,112 --> 00:00:23,942
I'll give your paper to Hawking.

7
00:00:24,114 --> 00:00:26,244
(Sheldon:)Great. Thank you. Oh, that's terrific.

8
00:00:26,408 --> 00:00:31,538
(Howard:)But in exchange,
l'd like you to do a few things for me.

9
00:00:31,704 --> 00:00:33,334
(Sheldon:)What kinds of things?

10
00:00:33,498 --> 00:00:38,088
(Howard:)Are you familiar
with the 12 labors of Hercules?

11
00:00:39,879 --> 00:00:41,379
(Sheldon:)Of course.

12
00:00:41,548 --> 00:00:43,798
(Howard:)You should be so lucky.

13
00:00:46,678 --> 00:00:50,018
(Sheldon:)All right.
What would you like me to do first?

14
00:00:50,181 --> 00:00:55,141
Well, I thought l'd start you off
by polishing my beIt buckles.

15
00:00:55,311 --> 00:00:59,651
By all means. Yeah, when I was a boy,
l would polish my Mee-Maw's silver.

